<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-PAKISTAN 28-2 IN 2ND INNINGS V SRI LANKA - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN 28-2 IN 2ND INNINGS V SRI LANKA - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan, needing 426 for victory, were 28 for two when bad light ended play on the fourth day of the second and final test against Sri Lanka on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scores: Sri Lanka 331 and 386-4 declared; Pakistan 292 and 28-2.</p>
</text>
